--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Until now this repository was public with no LICENSE file at all. That is not
a neutral state. Under the Berne Convention and the copyright law of virtually
every country, unlicensed work is "all rights reserved" by default — but in
practice, a public repository with no licence invites the assumption that the
code is free to take, and leaves the Owner arguing after the fact.

Naming the terms explicitly is what makes them enforceable without a dispute.

