--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NON-CUSTODIAL — WHAT THIS SOFTWARE DOES NOT DO
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FBT Swap is a non-custodial interface. It never takes possession of user
funds, never holds private keys, and cannot move, freeze, reverse or recover
any transaction. Every transaction is signed by the user, in their own wallet,
and broadcast directly to a public blockchain.

The Owner is not a bank, an exchange, a broker, a custodian, or a money
services business, and does not provide investment advice.

